  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Enterprise St Helena 2013/14 to 2016/17</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support private sector development and tourism-led growth in St Helena by part funding the St Helena Government&#x2019;s development agency, &#x201c;Enterprise St Helena&#x201d;.  Increased private sector capacity will help deliver the island&#x2019;s national goal of sustainable economic, social and environment development and will, in the longer-term, reduce reliance on UK budgetary aid.</narrative>
  </description>
